  "title": "Why White Lilac at Bridgwater Arts Centre is the one gig you should see this week",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><em>16th June 2015</em></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-8387 size-large\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/06/16761_431631416987699_3056823681859735426_n-e1434439814891-724x450.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"724\" height=\"450\" srcset=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/06/16761_431631416987699_3056823681859735426_n-e1434439814891-724x450.jpg 724w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/06/16761_431631416987699_3056823681859735426_n-e1434439814891-300x187.jpg 300w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/06/16761_431631416987699_3056823681859735426_n-e1434439814891.jpg 960w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 724px) 100vw, 724px\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Artist:</strong> White Lilac</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Venue:</strong> Bridgwater Arts Centre</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Date:</strong> Friday 19th June, 19.30</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"http://bridgwaterartscentre.co.uk/events/event/eclectic-lemon-presents-3/\" target=\"_blank\">Tickets</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Having been labelled as the &#8216;<a href=\"http://fluxpresents.com/track-of-the-week-white-lilac-the-girl-who-stole-the-eiffel-tower\" target=\"_blank\">dark horse band of 2015</a>&#8216;, Wiltshire four-piece White Lilac have gained enough momentum in recent times to make this gig at Bridgwater Arts Centre a tempting proposition. With delicate vocals by Fayer Rogers, the band specialise in haunting soundscapes and charming dreaminess &#8211; a sound that brings Marc Collin&#8217;s <a href=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/artist-of-the-week-bristol/\" target=\"_blank\">Bristol project</a> to mind.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">With latest single &#8216;The Girl Who Stole the Eiffel Tower&#8217; released just a few weeks ago, now could be the perfect time to catch White Lilac.</p>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?url=https%3A//api.soundcloud.com/tracks/207436940&amp;auto_play=false&amp;hide_related=false&amp;show_comments=true&amp;show_user=true&amp;show_reposts=false&amp;visual=true\" width=\"100%\" height=\"450\" frameborder=\"no\" scrolling=\"no\"></iframe></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Conal Dougan</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p>",
